  skillName: "Thanh Long Thi\xEAn Tru"
  level: 29
  skillPoint: 100000
  description: " (\u9752\u9F99\u5929\u8BDB)Tu s\u0129 d\u1EABn \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EEDu
    thi\xEAn th\u1EA7n l\xF4i, l\u1EA5y linh l\u1EF1c l\xE0m c\u1ED1t, thi\xEAn uy
    l\xE0m h\u1ED3n, ng\u01B0ng t\u1EE5 ra m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1EA7u Thanh Long L\xF4i
    Linh d\xE0i ng\xE0n tr\u01B0\u1EE3ng. Long th\xE2n do v\xF4 t\u1EADn l\xF4i \u0111\xECnh
    \u0111an xen t\u1EA1o th\xE0nh, v\u1EA3y r\u1ED3ng l\xF3e l\xEAn \xE1nh lam t\u1EED
    s\u1EAFc, m\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1EC1u khi\u1EBFn
    h\u01B0 kh\xF4ng rung chuy\u1EC3n.\n Thanh Long ng\u1EA9ng \u0111\u1EA7u g\u1EA7m
    th\xE9t, m\u1EDF mi\u1EC7ng phun ra Thi\xEAn Ph\u1EA1t L\xF4i T\u1EE9c, v\u1EA1n
    \u0111\u1EA1o s\u1EA5m s\xE9t gi\xE1ng xu\u1ED1ng nh\u01B0 di\u1EC7t th\u1EBF
    th\u1EA7n ki\u1EBFp, \u0111\u1EE7 s\u1EE9c ph\xE1 tan h\u1ED9 s\u01A1n \u0111\u1EA1i
    tr\u1EADn, nghi\u1EC1n n\xE1t nguy\xEAn th\u1EA7n, tru s\xE1t t\xE0 ma v\u1EA1n
    c\u1ED5.\n Kh\u1EA9u quy\u1EBFt: \n \"C\u1EEDu thi\xEAn d\u1EABn l\xF4i, thanh
    long hi\u1EC7n th\u1EBF. \n   Thi\xEAn uy h\xF3a th\u1EA7n, v\u1EA1n ph\xE1p
    quy l\xF4i!\""
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2ba037a8c1fe11b4e832b6374f279ecc, type: 3}
